      "message": "My 2 cents:\nEncryption has happened when the code reaches here.\nWe should do EATT connection only if the remote version \u003e\u003d 5.2.\nIf version is unknown, skip the eatt. \nif (remote_lmp_version !\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 remote_lmp_version \u003e\u003d HCI_PROTO_VERSION_5_2) {\nfeels more explicit",
